        f"- Natural Replay windows: {result['population']['window_count']}.",
        "",
        "## Fixed-review results",
        "",
        "| Method | HFC@10% | Fail concentration@10% | HFC@20% | Fail concentration@20% |",
        "|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|",
