#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Run the JSAC Phase-4 Layer-2 train-policy-development dry-run.

The command has two explicit gates:

1. ``--freeze-decisions`` materializes outcome-blind weekly scores, candidate
   prefixes, review-order inputs, and a hash manifest.
2. ``--evaluate`` verifies that manifest before reading target outcomes and
   execution completeness for the labeled historical audit.

Replay-A/B is never read.
"""
